  prompt: Inspect
  id: whitlock_suitcase
  title: Ada's suitcase
  text: Ada's suitcase, still packed. A Greyhound ticket to Tulsa is tucked under the strap, dated April 1980. Never punched. The clothes inside are three years out of fashion and freshly ironed.
  subject: Ada Whitlock
  customPrompt: Look at the suitcase
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
